    "description": "The Telecom SIM Activation API facilitates the bulk activation of telecom SIM cards, allowing businesses to efficiently manage large-scale deployments. This API enables users to submit activation requests for multiple SIM cards in a single operation, streamlining the onboarding process for new customers. Typical consumers include telecom service providers and enterprise customers managing predominantly large subscriptions. By using this API, organizations can improve their operational efficiency and enhance customer satisfaction with faster activation times.",
